QsMessengerServer 1.0.2a Preview Available  

Main changes:

- Relay functions have all been adapted for instant forwarding;  
  
- Almost all database queries use "email" as primary key;  
  
- ( The database also has some changes; )  
  
- Some unused variables and functions have been removed;  
  
- Logging is only started with the "-log" program argument;  
  (Two distinct client classes are used to spare processing time)  

* sessionId not yet removed;
  
It is still a new preview, other errors are not excluded, but it does seem to be ok for now.  
  
Other changes like maximum clients, workload management, IP lookup and filtering may also be included...
 


  
